{"page":{"id":"bb0a6012-fb7f-4465-9d91-16422232c94d","theme":"dungeons-and-dragons","slug":"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun","title":"Faerûn","meta_title":"Faerûn (Dungeons & Dragons) — place, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"Faerûn is the continental heart of the Forgotten Realms, home to Waterdeep, Candlekeep, the Sword Coast, and the cities that define modern D&D fiction.…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Continent at the heart of the <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms\" class=\"entity-link\">Forgotten Realms</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Forgotten Realms</strong></a>, <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Sword Coast</strong></a>, <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/ed-greenwood\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Ed Greenwood</strong></a>, <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/candlekeep\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Candlekeep</strong></a>, <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/waterdeep\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Waterdeep</strong></a> and <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/baldurs-gate\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Baldur&#039;s Gate</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Faerûn connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Located In:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms\" class=\"entity-link\">Forgotten Realms</a>\n            — Faerûn is the Realms&#039; main continent.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast\" class=\"entity-link\">Sword Coast</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast\" class=\"entity-link\">Sword Coast</a> is western Faerûn.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/ed-greenwood\" class=\"entity-link\">Ed Greenwood</a>\n            — <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/ed-greenwood\" class=\"entity-link\">Ed Greenwood</a> is connected to Faerûn through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/candlekeep\" class=\"entity-link\">Candlekeep</a>\n            — Faerûn is connected to <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/candlekeep\" class=\"entity-link\">Candlekeep</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/waterdeep\" class=\"entity-link\">Waterdeep</a>\n            — Faerûn is connected to <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/waterdeep\" class=\"entity-link\">Waterdeep</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/baldurs-gate\" class=\"entity-link\">Baldur&#039;s Gate</a>\n            — <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/baldurs-gate\" class=\"entity-link\">Baldur&#039;s Gate</a> is connected to Faerûn through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/lolth\" class=\"entity-link\">Lolth</a>\n            — <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/lolth\" class=\"entity-link\">Lolth</a> is connected to Faerûn through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/torm\" class=\"entity-link\">Torm</a>\n            — <a href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/torm\" class=\"entity-link\">Torm</a> is connected to Faerûn through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">6</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/ed-greenwood\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Ed Greenwood</strong>\n                    <span>Creator of the Forgotten Realms.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/candlekeep\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Candlekeep</strong>\n                    <span>Fortress-library of lore on the Sword Coast.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/dungeons-and-dragons/forgotten-realms/faerun/sword-coast/